    "前缀和"
  ],
  "summary": "每次可把下标 i>0 的一个单位移到 i-1，求经过任意操作后数组最大值的最小可能值。",
  "insight": "前 i+1 个元素总和无法向右移出该前缀，因此最大值至少为其平均值向上取整；所有前缀下界的最大值也可通过从右向左均衡达到。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "只能向左移动",
    "前缀和使用 long",
    "平均值需要向上取整"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "maximum-ceiling-prefix-average",
      "title": "最大前缀平均上取整",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "所有前缀容量约束共同决定答案。",
      "steps": [
        "prefix=0、answer=0",
        "扫描 i 加 nums[i]",
        "bound=ceil(prefix/(i+1))",
        "answer=max(answer,bound)"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/maximum-ceiling-prefix-average/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/maximum-ceiling-prefix-average/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/maximum-ceiling-prefix-average/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
